                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                  <div class="tool-item">
                    <span>颜色简化</span>
                    <div>
                      <input type="range" min="0" max="16" step="1" v-model.number="preQuantizeLevels" @input="refreshDebounced" />
                      <span>{{ preQuantizeLevels > 1 ? preQuantizeLevels + t('preview.levelsPerChannel') : t('preview.disabled') }}</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="tool-item">
                <label>智能模式</label>
                <div class="row" style="gap:.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                  <button class="btn-secondary" @click="applySmartCartoon" :disabled="isRefreshing || isRendering">漫画模式</button>
                  <button class="btn-secondary" @click="applySmartPhoto" :disabled="isRefreshing || isRendering || !extractedColors">照片模式</button>
                  <button class="btn-secondary" @click="applySmartPixelArt" :disabled="isRefreshing || isRendering">像素风</button>
                  <button class="btn-secondary" @click="applySmartNeon" :disabled="isRefreshing || isRendering">赛博霓虹</button>
                  <button class="btn-secondary" @click="applySmartPastelJP" :disabled="isRefreshing || isRendering">清新日系</button>
                  <button class="btn-secondary" @click="applySmartNES" :disabled="isRefreshing || isRendering">NES/FC 像素风</button>
                </div>
                <div class="smart-hints">
                  <p><strong>说明</strong>：智能模式仅调整渲染参数（算法/抖动/Gamma/亮度/约束/海报化），<u>不会改变当前画风（配色）</u>。</p>
                  <p><strong>像素风</strong>：减少颜色等级（海报化），关闭抖动，边缘清晰。</p>
                  <p><strong>赛博霓虹</strong>：高饱和、高对比，推荐 HSV/CIEDE2000，建议开启轻度抖动。</p>
                  <p><strong>清新日系</strong>：低饱和、稍提亮，柔和观感，推荐 CIEDE2000。</p>
                  <p><strong>NES/FC 像素风</strong>：小色表，高对比，建议低分辨率与海报化/无抖动。</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="tool-actions">
                <button class="btn-secondary" @click="refreshCustomPreview" :disabled="isRefreshing">
                  <span v-if="isRefreshing" class="loading-spinner"></span>
